TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, 10 shifts, exchange in each cell

SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial in cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -correct_disp true
    -time_step 1
    -print_cells 3
    -print_frequency 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -file selected.csv
    -high_precision true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell SI_Halite
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, CELL_NO, SI("Halite")

END
